  "steps": [
    "Cut the cucumber into chunky half-moons and chop the tomatoes into bite-sized wedges.",
    "Thinly slice the red onion and add it to a serving bowl with the cucumber, tomatoes, and olives.",
    "Crumble the feta over the top.",
    "Whisk the olive oil, red wine vinegar, oregano, salt, and black pepper together, then drizzle over the salad.",
    "Toss gently and serve immediately, while the vegetables are crisp and the feta is still distinct."
